          "dimension": "Smart-contract / protocol",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Clarity is a decidable, non-Turing-complete language which eliminates entire classes of reentrancy bugs, but the sBTC peg contracts and AI-agent interaction surfaces are novel enough that meaningful unaudited attack surface remains.",
