        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "The $160M+ trading volume milestone and cross-chain USDCx bridging via Allbridge are growth signals, but total locked value is still small relative to Ethereum L2s, making large exits price-disruptive.",
